      "blocks": [
        {
          "ref": "p0065#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "例3 解方程",
            "$\\operatorname{tg}x=\\sqrt{3}$。",
            "根据(2)式得：",
            "$x=\\operatorname{arctg}\\sqrt{3}+\\pi n,\\quad n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$，",
            "$x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi n,\\quad n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "例4 解方程",
            "$\\operatorname{tg}x=5.177$。",
            "根据(2)式得：",
            "$x=\\operatorname{arctg}5.177+\\pi k,\\ x\\approx1.38+\\pi k,\\ k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "现在列出正切的基本性质。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "1. 函数的定义域是除去$\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n$（其中$n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$）这种形式的",
            "数以外所有实数集合。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "2. 正切函数值的集合是整个数轴：$E(\\operatorname{tg})=\\mathbf{R}$。因此，",
            "正切是无界函数。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "3. 正切是奇函数：对于所有的$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，$\\operatorname{tg}(-x)=↵-\\operatorname{tg}x$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "4. 正切是具有最小正周期$\\pi$的周期函数：对于所有的",
            "$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，$\\operatorname{tg}(x+\\pi)=\\operatorname{tg}x$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "5. 对于所有的$x=\\pi n(n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x=0$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "6. 对于所有的$x\\in]\\pi n,\\ \\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n[\\ (n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x>0$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#10",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "7. 对于所有的$x\\in]-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n,\\ \\pi n[\\ (n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x<0$。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#11",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "8. 对于所有的$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，函数$\\operatorname{tg}$连续并且有导数。"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0065#12",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "lines": [
            "59"
          ],
          "owners": null,
          "open": false,
          "cont": false,
          "samerow": false
        }
      ]
    },
